  m_Name: Ladder_Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - text: In the first few days after it happened, I kept watch from the top of the
      lighthouse, from dawn till dusk.
    duration: 3
  - text: "The horizon stayed empty\u2014no ships, no voices, no one. What\u2019s
      the point anymore?"
    duration: 3
